{"id":"n66778-1-8","stage":2,"title":"알아맞히다 · 猜中","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66778-1-8-1","ko":"승규 씨는 서른 살일 것 같은데요.","zh":"承奎先生看起来应该有三十岁吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎","readings":[{"term":"승규","audio":"/audio/20c7bbd00a1a5f26d499.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규","audio":"/audio/20c7bbd00a1a5f26d499.mp3"}},{"text":"씨는","meaning":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","explanation":"씨：用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58145","senseId":"1","lemma":"씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"씨는","audio":"/audio/1e98662e92cdd5672d9e.mp3"}},{"text":"서른","meaning":"三十","explanation":"서른：三十","readings":[{"term":"서른","audio":"/audio/e2739e161b065c33c6b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31570","senseId":"1","lemma":"서른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서른","audio":"/audio/e2739e161b065c33c6b4.mp3"}},{"text":"살일","meaning":"岁","explanation":"살：岁；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67887","senseId":"1","lemma":"살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살일","audio":"/audio/06246bcf5a8691931236.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같은데요.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；은데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같은데요","audio":"/audio/441937d13341d37ec5fd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c90eea3c6347f1e0","term":"씨","zh":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3","entryId":"58145","definition":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","pronunciation":["씨"]},{"id":"e2739e161b065c33","term":"서른","zh":"三十","audio":"/audio/e2739e161b065c33c6b4.mp3","entryId":"31570","definition":"十的三倍的数目。","pronunciation":["서른"]},{"id":"d804a5a98c800c56","term":"살","zh":"岁","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3","entryId":"67887","definition":"计算年龄的数量单位。","pronunciation":["살"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/a38e99a4ed3ad5027c67.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66778-1-8-2","ko":"네, 맞아요. 제 나이를 바로 알아맞혔네요.","zh":"是的，没错。您一下子就猜对我的年龄了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"맞아요.","meaning":"正确，对","explanation":"맞다：正确，对；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"1","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞아요","audio":"/audio/bcc473b26491895baa49.mp3"}},{"text":"제","meaning":"嗯，那个","explanation":"저：嗯，那个；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71216","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제","audio":"/audio/b94e182b9a95d9dc2329.mp3"}},{"text":"나이를","m